OL,3,GNEWSATeacher threatened to rip out
OL,4,Apupils' vocal cords
OL,5,
OL,6,FA supply teacher found to have made
OL,7,Fracist comments towards pupils and
OL,8,Fthreatened to "rip their vocal cords
OL,9,Fout and feed them to the lions" has
OL,10,Fbeen banned.
OL,12,FAnton Van Der Watt was struck off after
OL,13,Fmaking offensive and aggressive remarks
OL,14,Fat Brine Leas School in Nantwich,
OL,15,FCheshire, in April 2025.
OL,17,FThe Teacher Regulation Agency also
OL,18,Ffound he demonstrated aggressive
OL,19,Fbehaviour towards the students, which
OL,20,Fincluded pushing and pinching.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
