OL,5,
OL,6,FVan Der Watt was not present at the
OL,7,Fhearing held in July, but in an email
OL,8,Fhe sent in August, he apologised to
OL,9,F"anyone that experienced stress or
OL,10,Fhardship through my alleged actions".
